{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X的感受句较密，部分较长的感受又只在音乐到点时出现，扫读时容易漏掉；Y的左右分栏更容易快速浏览。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】把每段叙事的关键转折突出出来，又通过与音乐进程同步出现的感受，把人物的犹疑、自我辩解、怀念和逐渐接受串成连续的心理变化。尤其是召唤、旧歌、舞步、摇篮曲和脚步等声音意象反复出现并发生变化，使前后有明显呼应，感受也更具体、有层次；Y的故事主线更容易扫读，但不少感受压缩成短词后，细腻程度和彼此之间的联系有所减弱。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b7c02bb9-5343-4d37-a430-1dea08626edd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T065219070315Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:53:16.139346+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "82edcdf766c29bc7640410cc0a432e4bc1c1ecb7d4163889a0c755b34a03f0d8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2